title: Payers › Workflow view › Read the path in a side panel
route: any page that offers 'View workflow'
intro: The same read-only canvas opens in a right-hand panel from New Case (the 'View workflow' button on a case's Workflow line) and from History & Changes (a version). With a run behind it, it shows which steps were executed, skipped or are still pending. It never edits anything.
dir: TD
---
start s1 "Click 'View workflow' on a case's Workflow line\nor open a version in History & Changes"
overlay o1 "Right-hand panel\nTitle: the workflow's name\nPill Published, Draft or Archived, 'Version N', the dates it applies from"
decision d1 "Is the workflow still in the library?"
screen m1 "'The workflow this case followed has been removed from the library. The case keeps what it recorded.'"
decision d2 "Was a version asked for?"
process p1 "That saved version is drawn, not the current one\n'Saved by ..., ... The reason.' at the foot"
process p2 "The current workflow is drawn"
screen fx "Four facts\nRequest type, Services, State and plan, Owner"
decision d3 "Is a run given?"
screen tr "A box with the run's one-sentence outcome\n'7 done · 2 skipped · 17 pending · 1 stopped or waiting. Other steps were not reached on this path.'"
screen cv "Read-only canvas, 'Name, version N, read only'\nWith a run, steps wear Done, Skipped, Failed, Waiting, Manual review, Pending or Not reached\nand the lines it followed are heavier"
click c1 "Click a step"
screen sel "The step's name and state\nWhat happened there (the run's sentence), or what the step does"
screen ph "'The path so far'\nOne row per step in order, with its outcome and sentence"
screen rr "'Payer rules it points at'\nEach with Verified, Needs review, Unverified or Superseded, its source, dates and version\nA line when any is not verified"
click c2 "Click 'Open in Workflow Builder'"
process p3 "Goes to the payer's builder on that workflow"
click c3 "Click X, press Escape or click the dim area"
end e1 "The reader knows which path the case took"
goto g1 "Continues in: Authorizations › New Case › Workflow › What the workflow adds to the history"

s1 --> o1 --> d1
d1 -->|No| m1
d1 -->|Yes| d2
d2 -->|Yes| p1 --> fx
d2 -->|No| p2 --> fx
fx --> d3
d3 -->|Yes| tr --> cv
d3 -->|No| cv
cv --> c1 --> sel
cv --> ph --> rr
rr --> c2 --> p3
sel --> c3 --> e1
m1 --> c3
p3 --> e1
e1 --> g1
